      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully maintained 4 Bedroom Home in picturesque Rosscarbery, West Cork."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Set in a beautiful and picturesque part of Rosscarbery, this exceptionally well-maintained home offers a wonderful combination of space, comfort, and convenience.\r\nIdeally located just 2 minutes from one of West Cork's best loved destinations, Rosscarbery, equi-distantant from Clonakilty and Skibbereen,\r\nThe property is perfectly positioned for enjoying all that West Cork has to offer.\r\nThe area is renowned for its stunning coastline, beaches, countryside, and vibrant local community..\r\nThe property includes two bathrooms and a spacious living accommodation, with plenty of room for everyday living and entertaining.\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a large private garden, providing an excellent space for relaxing, gardening, or enjoying the outdoors.\r\nThere is also a good-sized shed, offering useful additional storage.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nBeautiful picturesque location in Rosscarbery, 2 minutes from Rosscarbery Town\r\n15 minutes from both Clonakilty and Skibbereen\r\n3 Large Double Bedrooms, 1 Single Bedroom, 2 Bathrooms\r\nLarge private garden, shed for storage. \r\nGreat location to explore The Wild Atlantic Way"
      },
      {
